# MedFliq

MedFliq is an AI-native healthcare intelligence platform website built to present healthcare automation, smart medical documentation, workflow intelligence, and contact support through a modern responsive web interface.

## Project Overview

This project includes a responsive frontend landing website with multiple pages, smooth animations, reusable UI components, and a backend-powered contact form. The contact form is connected to a FastAPI backend and can be integrated with Google Sheets for storing user submissions.

## Tech Stack

### Frontend

* React
* Vite
* TypeScript
* Tailwind CSS
* React Router
* Framer Motion / CSS Animations

### Backend

* FastAPI
* Python
* Google Sheets API
* Environment-based configuration

### Deployment

* Frontend: Vercel
* Backend: Render
* Version Control: GitHub

## Pages

* Home
* About
* Services
* Contact
* Privacy Policy
* Terms and Conditions

## Features

* Modern responsive UI
* BluBridge-inspired translucent navbar
* Smooth page transitions
* Reusable components
* Contact form integration
* Google Sheets contact data storage
* SEO-friendly page structure
* Privacy and Terms pages
* Deployment-ready frontend configuration
* Environment variable based API connection

